# Bamboo staging: leaf tiers live in rotation (0 none, 1 small, 2 large —
# MC's leaves property). The 4px stalk box draws in the opaque pass;
# tiered cells also emit a leaf cross into the flowers order. Flat floor
# is SANDSTONE at y=0; AIR starts at y=1.
# Columns are staged one cell per tick: same-tick placement events have no
# order guarantee and a stacked bamboo only survives once the cell below
# holds bamboo.
wait_idle 20 6000
setblock 4 1 8 BAMBOO 0
wait 2
setblock 6 1 8 BAMBOO 0
wait 2
setblock 6 2 8 BAMBOO 0
wait 2
setblock 6 3 8 BAMBOO 0
wait 2
setblock 6 4 8 BAMBOO 1
wait 2
setblock 6 5 8 BAMBOO 2
wait 2
setblock 8 1 8 BAMBOO_SAPLING 0
wait 2
setblock 10 1 8 BAMBOO 2
wait 30
assert_block 4 1 8 BAMBOO
assert_block 6 5 8 BAMBOO
assert_block 8 1 8 BAMBOO_SAPLING
assert_block 10 1 8 BAMBOO
camera 7.0 4.5 3.5 180 10
wait 20
screenshot bamboo
echo bamboo done
